---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Us"
	description="Learn about Thinker Scripts, a tech philosophy publication for developers studying software engineering through systems thinking, first principles, and deep reading."
	keywords={[
		'about Thinker Scripts',
		'tech philosophy blog',
		'philosophy of software engineering',
		'systems thinking software design',
		'deep reading for developers',
	]}
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">ABOUT US</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-pretty text-neutral-950 sm:text-7xl dark:text-white">
			A publication for developers who think in systems.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
			Thinker Scripts publishes long-form writing about software engineering philosophy, technical judgment, cognitive tools for programming, and the design of interfaces that support careful reading.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="border-y border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-14 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1fr] lg:px-8">
			<div>
				<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">EDITORIAL FOCUS</p>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Software as a discipline of thought.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="grid gap-5 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
				<p>
					The site is built for readers who want more than quick implementation notes. Essays connect programming practice with epistemology, systems theory, interface mechanics, and first-principles reasoning.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our goal is to make complex technical ideas easier to study without flattening them. The archive, topic pages, and article tools are designed around discovery, attention, and durable reference.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
